k. Existing native rejection ledger is reused; no DELETE/reset or fake JWT/SQL impersonation.\", \"Helpers/tables remain private; both new Staff RPCs explicitly revoke default access and grant authenticated, each checks Staff identity. New CHECKs constrain singleton/hash, scope mode/hash/version/roster/object; existing CHECKs not removed.\", \"J1→J2 migration preserves exact raw backup and pending key; new commands bind stable execution context fields. Staff receipts require protected native receipt with exact source/carrier/session and cannot be accepted as World.\", \"Three live-captured booking callbacks read: no-activation/no-seal guard allows technical booking; sync creates no applicant/ready without activation; deferred hint branch writes display metadata and returns before AI code.\", \"Namespace audit artifact matches frozen DB hash:348 embedded expressions across10 functions reports zero unbound inputs/alias collisions; surrogate PL grammar and20 top-level SQL statements parsed by author. This is static evidence, not catalog compilation.\", \"Independent Node --check executed on frozen canonical UI with exit0. No DB execution, browser, Staff or provider used by reviewer.\"], \"material_gate_separate\": [\"Root stageA installer/preflight/recovery material must compose against actual current Root and all affected header/schema/ACL/config fingerprints; this review does not approve a repin or obsolete body reinstall.\", \"Pin exact callback trigger inventory and existing rejection ledger shape/permissions as dependencies in material preflight.\", \"Initial gates must remain inert/reserved; World opening requires the authorized same-version Staff result.\"]}, \"sha256\": \"6f5212bdb1aa1dc31a6de9a1dc6b20d5de12373dd218eb73f46ccc226858d4ec\"}, \"schema_version\": \"mission-party-launch-source-plan/1\", \"helper_provenance\": [{\"delta\": \"Only C path rebound to immutable helper snapshot; no function code changed.\", \"source_path\": \"/Users/antonello/Desktop/theu